{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261126/photo/bkn-20261126055309503-1126_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261126060118\"/><p>港鐵天水圍站有工程車設備故障。</p><p>港鐵今日(26日)清晨5時51分表示，由於天水圍站有工程車設備故障, 屯馬綫的列車班次已調整。候車時間預計會比平日多10-15分鐘。</p><p>來往屯門至元朗預計（25分鐘一班） 來往元朗至烏溪沙站（8分鐘一班） 港鐵現正提供免費接駁巴士來往元朗站和屯門站，途經沿途各站。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T22:16:23.419625+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T21:53:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T22:09:52.471343+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T22:09:52.471343+00:00","content_hash":"eb46e865295c1e22ac15800d46e0aa800a7eeb7aacc00cd0d5dd5f21da4f05fa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}